Mode: MATCHING
User matches left column A with right column B.

Rules:
- Each answer is one correct pair: "left - right" (space-hyphen-space).
- All left items distinct; all right items distinct.
- "answers" = ONLY correct pairs. No wrong options. No "right" field.
- Do NOT create multiple-choice or fill-in-the-blank questions.
- Question text must ask to match (e.g. "Match each word with its meaning:").

Pair ideas: word–definition, synonym, antonym, verb–object.
Answer format: {"answer":"left - right"}
